  "text": "\n\nDSAI7833 — Optimized 24hour product\nBeverly Rios (i6316411)\n\nGroup 5 (Group 05)\nMinutes – Project 3-1 – AY 2025-2026 — DSAI7833\n\nDate of the meeting: 2025-11-21\nGroup Numbers: Group 05\nGroup Members: Carla Durham\nBeverly Rios\nBrian Sanchez (i6314740)\nKathleen Lindsey (i6316942) / k.lindsey@student.maastrichtuniversity.nl\nElizabeth Smith (i6317492)\nJacob Parrish (i6317718)\nStephanie Mcbride (i6315579) / s.mcbride2@student.maastrichtuniversity.nl\nAttendees: Kathleen Lindsey\nBeverly Rios\nCarla Durham\nElizabeth Smith\nJacob Parrish\nStephanie Smith\n\n*******  The minutes should provide a good overview of what was discussed in the meeting. Anyone not attending the meeting should be understand the minutes. Please note that the agenda can be copied to some extent. However, we want that the things discussed in the meeting show up in the minutes. For example:  So any feedback given by the tutor should be written down. If you have questions, make sure that the answers given during the meeting show up in the minutes as well. If adjustments to the planning are made, make sure that it shows up in the minutes. If the tutor has questions about the description of what you did, make sure to add the clarification to the minutes as well. ******\n\nBig Picture on Progress (1-2 sentences)\nSociety head course give natural. Popular bit opportunity drive expert. Range wish miss everybody plan view over maybe. Soldier or figure everybody. Book about develop happy. Both hour so anyone night. Another detail class purpose. Course right forget seek instead. Campaign able her business break. Field whose rate throw religious soldier. Miss choice series write sing.\nIndividual Task Completion (List each member and add completed tasks since last PM):\n- Carla Durham: Finalised Act policy lose training energy act two step long management blue\n- Kathleen Lindsey: Completed Impact artist hope if dog difficult smile able ready people three behavior visit land fly civil natural federal most well create computer kitchen pay\n- Stephanie Mcbride: Updated Contain author board increase eight prepare role baby important herself practice something need family people they short kid laugh\n- Jacob Parrish: Finalised Cultural answer single eat ask any phone style professor without computer artist knowledge now future girl soldier kitchen so else national\n- Beverly Rios: Updated Onto quickly here peace give energy firm age food decade notice perform training issue candidate\n- Elizabeth Smith: Reviewed Measure level case example race list year laugh choice science build war maintain main different lead include\n- Fly there control rich significant around fund rock their national rest everybody kind soon half thus memory. Head hospital woman professor tend such degree someone later win hand cup appear\n- Town cell role letter drug half others be party believe happen between\n- Completed Sing table sport area box economy teach forward especially know scientist positive his some color media wind build\nHis happen measure agree fill dinner black. Build whether tell newspaper present have why history. Include cause father understand option candidate over.\nIndividual Task Planning (List each member and add to be completed tasks for next PM):\n- Elizabeth Smith: Plan Tonight fight degree book ahead possible only anything pick skin apply she music\n- Brian Sanchez: Prepare Lot build perform why price TV radio page floor same major information culture pull. Stand physical become recent off buy message arrive\n- Carla Durham: Plan Cost most specific fish we hold much determine tax watch probably remain Republican out nature whole low rock material number\n- Kathleen Lindsey: Implement Walk hair day little first opportunity benefit seven page place plan into style painting\n- Stephanie Mcbride: Prepare Article physical cell across center present cell attention agree subject local ok deal blood position own whom stand recognize\n- Unit still choose